legend [label=<<TABLE BORDER="1" CELLBORDER="0" CELLPADDING="6"><TR><TD><B>Keys and relationships</B></TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT">PK primary key · FK foreign key · UQ unique constraint</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT">* required attribute · parent-to-child cardinalities on connectors</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT">orders.items is the compatibility snapshot; a trigger maintains order_items.</TD></TR><TR><TD ALIGN="LEFT">Child labels show cardinality. Matching UQ# fields share a constraint.</TD></TR></TABLE>>];
